# Generated design record (SPEC-0010). The pipeline stages the record into the
# docs content root and emits the derived data module; neither is ever committed.
# This one fact is what separates the pipeline from "copy the files in": there is
# no tracked copy to review, to diff, or to edit by hand, so there is no copy to rot.
/website/docs/decisions/
/website/docs/specs/
/website/src/generated/
